0.96 0.98 1 rg 0 0 842 595 re f
BT /F2 18 Tf 36 562 Td (Relationship Summary) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 36 542 Td (Readable client notes for the complete system) Tj ET
0.14 0.42 0.55 RG 1.5 w 36 532 m 806 532 l S
BT /F2 14 Tf 55 485 Td (Main business relationships) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 70 455 Td (1. Users perform actions across the system according to role: admin, librarian, purchaser, representative, guard.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 70 430 Td (2. Dorm rooms contain many dorm students; each active student can be assigned one room and one bed.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 70 405 Td (3. Dorm students can have representative collections, food finance records, documents, profile photos and cards.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 70 380 Td (4. Library members borrow book copies; every loan links member, book title, physical copy and recording user.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 70 355 Td (5. Books can have many physical copies, each with its own barcode/copy code and inventory status.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 70 330 Td (6. Finance transactions connect category, donor, project, student if needed, attachments and audit history.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 70 305 Td (7. Membership cards are polymorphic: a card can belong to a dorm student or a library member.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 70 280 Td (8. Audit logs store sensitive system actions such as user changes, finance changes, student changes and library actions.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 55 230 Td (Security and privacy note) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 70 200 Td (This client ERD intentionally hides technical Laravel tables and sensitive fields such as password hashes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 70 175 Td (Uploaded private dorm documents and finance attachments are represented by path fields, not exposed file contents.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 70 150 Td (For a client presentation, pages 2, 3 and 4 can be shown separately to explain each module clearly.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 36 24 Td (Fanous Dormitory & Library Management System - ERD for client presentation) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 760 24 Td (Page 5) Tj ET
endstream
